  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2007-10-27.Bridge_School_Benefit** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 31 min [1]. Said about its sound: Lawn left side of stage even with speaker stack produced awesome sound at times [1]\n- **mmj2007-10-27.BridgeSchool_Day1**: source not stated; 7 songs; 30 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Eddie Vedder and Flea were scheduled to perform but did not appear [1]\n- Babies crying and kids playing audible due to close crowd with little children [1]\n- Metallica excluded from this recording as they sold their set for charity [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2007-10-27.Bridge_School_Benefit**: taped by Listen to Tom Leykis; transferred by Listen to Tom Leykis; source: Sony ecm cs 10 mics > Sony netmd [1]\n- **mmj2007-10-27.BridgeSchool_Day1**: taped by Josephine; transferred by Josephine; source: Schoeps MK4 > actives > NBox > Edirol R-09 @ 24bit/48kHz [2]. Also: Transfer from Edirol R-09 via Sound Forge 8.0 to CD Wave and FLAC [2]",
